exports[`C02-04 characterization 10: stale test app 1`] = `
{
  "error": 
"StaleTestAppError: the published test app is missing 1 test(s) this project's source declares:
  Sandbox Tests.UnsupportedTest: the published test app does not contain UnsupportedTest, which this project's source declares
Refusing to measure: every mutant covered only by these would be recorded no-coverage and the run would report a plausible score for a suite that never ran. Publishing the test app is the operator's own workflow: LethAL deploys only the instrumented target. Recompile the target into the test project's .alpackages (a stale build can hide behind an unchanged version string), compile the test project, publish the resulting .app, and verify the container reports the version your test project's app.json declares. Then re-run."
